</office:automatic-styles><office:body><office:text><text:p text:style-name="Title">Salt Marsh Survey Report</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Byline">A synthetic two-column article for reading-order tests</text:p><text:section text:style-name="Cols2" text:name="S1"><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph A1. The marsh covers 12 km<text:span text:style-name="Sup">2</text:span> of tidal flats and channels<text:note text:note-class="footnote" text:id="fn1"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>Footnote one: tide tables came from a synthetic almanac made for this fixture.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note>, and the survey began at the northern dike. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph A1b. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph A2. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph A3. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph A4. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph A5. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph A6. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph A7. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p></text:section><text:p text:style-name="Mid">Findings by Zone</text:p><text:section text:style-name="Cols2" text:name="S2"><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph B1. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph B2. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph B3. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph B4. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph B5. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph B6. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p></text:section><text:p text:style-name="PageMid">Methods</text:p><text:section text:style-name="Cols2" text:name="S3"><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C1. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C2. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C3. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C4. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C5. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C6. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C7. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C8. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C9. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C10. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C11. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C12. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C13. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Paragraph C14. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p></text:section></office:text></office:body></office:document>
